 "description": "Triage origin tracing, export quota restrictions, and CSDDD supply-chain due diligence for critical minerals (lithium, rare earths, nickel, cobalt, copper, graphite, manganese, tungsten, gallium/germanium) before offtake or investment commitment. Returns origin traceability status, export quota flags, top supply-chain risks, and evidence gaps. Required tool arguments: project_name, commodity, origin_jurisdiction, decision_question, decision_stage, supplied_sources. Grades supplied evidence; it does not independently verify source truth. Obtain the source records requested by inputSchema before asking for a decision-ready result. Do not fabricate missing evidence. For a Middle Corridor sanctions question without evidence, use corridor_sanctions_assistant at https://corridor-sanctions-assistant-a2a.vassiliy-lakhonin.workers.dev/mcp for orientation only. Illustrative example arguments (synthetic; replace with your own data): {\"project_name\":\"Example spodumene offtake\",\"commodity\":\"lithium\",\"origin_jurisdiction\":\"KZ\",\"processing_jurisdiction\":\"CN\",\"target_market\":\"eu\",\"decision_question\":\"Is this offtake ready for a pre-signature human review?\",\"decision_stage\":\"pre_offtake_agreement\",\"supplied_sources\":[{\"source_type\":\"mining_concession_or_license_extract\",\"title\":\"Concession extract\",\"date\":\"2026-08-01\"},{\"source_type\":\"certified_ore_assay_report\",\"title\":\"Certified assay\",\"date\":\"2026-08-02\"}]}. Evaluation requires a signed Base USDC payment for the exact request, or Pro access. Discovery is free. Keep the original request and X-Payment-Signature for result recovery within 24 hours. Current prices: https://critical-minerals-due-diligence-a2a.vassiliy-lakhonin.workers.dev/.well-known/x402. Do not pay automatically. Evidence triage only: no factual-truth verification, no legal, compliance, sanctions, or financial advice. Human review is required before any commercial action.",
